WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:09.457
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.600 --> 00:09.457
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.970 --> 00:18.542
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.970 --> 00:18.542
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.684 --> 00:37.259
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.684 --> 00:37.259
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.633 --> 00:46.819
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.633 --> 00:46.820
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.053 --> 00:56.186
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.053 --> 00:56.187
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.346 --> 01:05.453
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.346 --> 01:05.453
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.802 --> 01:14.850
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.809 --> 01:14.850
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.870 --> 01:22.845
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.870 --> 01:22.845
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.778 --> 01:30.698
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.617 --> 01:33.952
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.828 --> 01:35.871
Black Jack.

01:48.130 --> 01:49.045
Largo!

01:49.130 --> 01:49.763
No!

01:49.803 --> 01:51.878
Stay still!

01:52.425 --> 01:54.884
I can't wash you if you don't stay still!

01:55.302 --> 01:59.639
Oh, why can't you stay still?

02:00.141 --> 02:03.688
Largo! Listen to me!

02:03.788 --> 02:05.693
Jeez, you little turd!

02:08.858 --> 02:13.653
If you don't stay still, I'll have Doc give you a shot later!

02:14.519 --> 02:16.875
Hey! Don't run away!

02:16.917 --> 02:17.483
Yes.

02:17.003 --> 02:18.450
Hey! Wait!

02:18.451 --> 02:19.826
Largo!

02:22.023 --> 02:22.626
Huh?

02:22.792 --> 02:24.425
Wait!

02:25.041 --> 02:27.542
Largo! Stop right there!

02:25.041 --> 02:25.728
Huh?

02:26.728 --> 02:28.214
A six year old girl?

02:28.861 --> 02:31.694
Eh? You can't determine the type of bacteria?

02:29.260 --> 02:31.345
Why, you little devil!

02:31.422 --> 02:35.145
Doc! She won't listen to me!

02:35.277 --> 02:37.052
I'm busy right now.

02:37.652 --> 02:39.172
Call me back later.

02:39.958 --> 02:41.667
I got you, Largo.

02:41.668 --> 02:43.669
Give it up!

02:44.129 --> 02:45.170
Largo!

02:45.171 --> 02:46.463
And you too, Pinoco.

02:46.965 --> 02:48.632
I'll really give you shots.

02:50.403 --> 02:52.783
No, Doc!

02:52.816 --> 02:54.009
We're sorry.

02:56.391 --> 02:57.857
You'd better clean up the mess.

02:58.059 --> 02:59.560
Yes...

03:01.318 --> 03:04.690
Largo! You'd better take a shower!

03:08.162 --> 03:11.356
Tezuka Osamu's original - "Playing Doctor"

03:08.162 --> 03:11.356
Playing Doctor

03:21.527 --> 03:23.278
Wait! Wait! Wait!

03:25.531 --> 03:27.449
Wait!

03:34.499 --> 03:36.166
Damn!

03:46.719 --> 03:48.478
Did you really think you got away?

03:49.388 --> 03:51.473
That's right.

03:51.974 --> 03:54.518
Forgive me, Kong.

03:54.797 --> 03:58.977
Sharaku, did you do something
bad that needs to be forgiven?

03:59.232 --> 04:00.524
Not really...

04:00.817 --> 04:02.317
Then don't act so timid.

04:02.318 --> 04:03.527
Act strong.

04:04.365 --> 04:05.198
Yeah!

04:05.241 --> 04:06.533
Not that strong!

04:06.743 --> 04:08.493
What am I supposed to...

04:08.661 --> 04:11.330
Take the bandage off already!

04:11.331 --> 04:13.075
I can't take it off.

04:13.095 --> 04:13.989
Don't say no!

04:14.009 --> 04:15.009
Take it off!

04:15.333 --> 04:15.728
Hey!

04:15.752 --> 04:17.461
You can't trick us.

04:18.963 --> 04:20.130
Sorry!

04:22.967 --> 04:24.468
Wait, Sharaku!

04:26.742 --> 04:29.639
Lady, by yonder blessed moon I swear...

04:30.099 --> 04:35.020
That tips with silver all these fruit-tree tops...

04:35.313 --> 04:38.398
O, swear not by the moon, the inconstant moon,

04:38.399 --> 04:40.400
That monthly changes in her circled orb,

04:40.693 --> 04:42.736
Lest that thy love prove likewise variable.

04:43.154 --> 04:44.196
O, Juliet...

04:44.697 --> 04:45.900
Keaton!

04:46.199 --> 04:47.407
I'm being chased!

04:48.335 --> 04:49.993
Where did he go?!

04:54.582 --> 04:56.430
Get out of my way!

04:56.430 --> 04:58.502
Hey! Didn't Sharaku come in here just now?

04:59.545 --> 05:01.713
No, I haven't seen him.

05:04.133 --> 05:06.343
We're in the middle of rehearsal...

05:10.473 --> 05:12.015
Hey, let's go.

05:20.441 --> 05:22.150
Hey, what was that?

05:23.361 --> 05:26.488
Juliet, did you catch a cold?

05:26.989 --> 05:29.992
O, Romeo, I have been feeling feverish since yesterday...

05:32.286 --> 05:33.286
Look out!

05:36.290 --> 05:36.915
Sharaku!

05:38.248 --> 05:39.290
I knew it.

05:39.595 --> 05:40.667
Sharaku!

05:40.668 --> 05:41.542
Stop it, Kong!

05:41.794 --> 05:42.670
What?!

05:42.688 --> 05:44.504
Don't tell me what to do!

05:44.505 --> 05:47.090
Fine, I'll take care of you both!

05:57.226 --> 05:58.705
Are you okay, Sharaku?

06:00.287 --> 06:02.997
At least the bandage is safe.

06:03.582 --> 06:05.708
Kong is really terrible.

06:07.169 --> 06:09.962
How could you let him do that?

06:10.589 --> 06:11.797
I can't help it.

06:11.798 --> 06:13.883
I'll beat him up next time, then.

06:26.450 --> 06:26.938
I'm home.

06:27.397 --> 06:29.148
It's late.

06:29.149 --> 06:30.733
Uh, yeah...

06:31.068 --> 06:32.735
Well, okay.

06:33.153 --> 06:35.738
I'm going shopping, so look after Chako.

06:36.823 --> 06:38.324
Look after the shop too!

06:41.536 --> 06:42.286
Welcome home.

06:42.287 --> 06:43.362
I'm home!

06:43.455 --> 06:45.248
How are you feeling, Chako?

06:46.959 --> 06:50.461
The doctor came again, and gave me a shot.

06:50.631 --> 06:51.485
Oh yeah?

06:51.755 --> 06:54.632
Nii-chan, did you check out the next book?

06:55.240 --> 06:56.313
Yeah.

06:56.843 --> 06:58.135
Could you read it?!

06:58.136 --> 07:00.096
I've been waiting all day.

07:01.056 --> 07:03.057
Sure, sure. Let me get to it.

07:03.850 --> 07:05.935
See, we've gotta wait,three minutes like this.

07:06.520 --> 07:10.273
Nii-chan, how long will it take for me to get better?

07:14.236 --> 07:19.073
The daddy frog with the big stomach
popped, and became flat!

07:22.452 --> 07:23.202
Chako!

07:23.203 --> 07:24.495
Are you okay, Chako?

07:25.789 --> 07:28.291
Nii-chan, that doctor I was talking about...

07:29.376 --> 07:31.002
Dr. Black Jack.

07:31.003 --> 07:32.086
Did you find him for me?

07:32.087 --> 07:33.129
No...

07:33.130 --> 07:34.380
Can you find him soon?

07:34.673 --> 07:36.632
I want him to heal me.

07:36.800 --> 07:37.884
But, Chako...

07:37.885 --> 07:39.302
Please, Nii-chan?

07:39.303 --> 07:41.596
Bring me Dr. Black Jack.

07:47.019 --> 07:50.295
So who is this Black-whatever doctor
that Chako is talking about?

07:50.522 --> 07:55.651
I guess Chako's friend, Yumiko-chan,
was operated on by that doctor.

07:55.652 --> 07:58.321
Her illness was completely cured after that.

07:58.822 --> 08:00.239
Where does he live?

08:00.657 --> 08:02.450
I can't find him.

08:02.451 --> 08:06.954
But since that friend bragged so much,
Chako really believes in that doctor.

08:29.770 --> 08:31.812
I recommend taking her to the hospital.

08:33.523 --> 08:35.775
It looks like it's more than just a regular case of TB.

08:36.235 --> 08:39.946
There's a possibility that another illness was contracted.

08:40.322 --> 08:41.739
Can she be cured?

08:42.324 --> 08:44.533
I can't say without further examination.

08:45.244 --> 08:47.787
She may need an operation, depending on the condition.

08:48.455 --> 08:49.455
Operation?

08:53.543 --> 08:58.381
Nii-chan, Dr. Black Jack is the only
Doctor who can treat my illness.

08:58.590 --> 08:59.858
That's not true!

08:59.884 --> 09:00.841
You'll be fine!

09:00.884 --> 09:01.884
No! No!

09:01.885 --> 09:04.178
I want Dr. Black Jack!

09:04.179 --> 09:05.805
Or I'll die!

09:05.889 --> 09:06.681
Chako!

09:06.682 --> 09:08.140
I don't want any other doctor!

09:08.141 --> 09:09.642
That's enough!

09:11.937 --> 09:12.853
<i>Chako...</i>

09:18.110 --> 09:21.195
I see cavities in her chest, so I'm sure it's TB.

09:21.280 --> 09:21.821
Yeah.

09:22.406 --> 09:25.700
But I can't find the TB bacteria in either
her sputum or her hemoptysis.

09:26.076 --> 09:29.370
Please, would you come check it out?

09:30.289 --> 09:31.150
Oh, don't say that!

09:31.150 --> 09:32.123
Just look at this!

09:32.124 --> 09:33.833
Haven't we been friends since med school?

09:35.127 --> 09:36.130
Oh, just please...

09:38.837 --> 09:40.464
Well, fine!

09:49.611 --> 09:50.569
I'm home!

09:51.780 --> 09:53.364
Chako! How do you feel?

09:56.076 --> 09:58.370
Chako... was hospitalized?

09:59.021 --> 10:00.523
Note: "is being hospitalized", "will need to operate on her"
"Please give me a call when", "Mom"

09:59.621 --> 10:00.579
Operation?!

10:01.873 --> 10:03.374
Ja... Chako...

10:08.797 --> 10:09.797
No! No!

10:09.798 --> 10:11.715
I want Dr. Black Jack!

10:11.925 --> 10:13.717
Or I'ill die!

10:18.460 --> 10:22.296
Chako, I'll go find Dr. Black Jack!

10:26.897 --> 10:28.844
Yes, who is it?

10:29.179 --> 10:32.973
Oh, you're Chako-chan's brother.

10:32.974 --> 10:36.018
I wanted to ask you about Dr. Black Jack,

10:36.019 --> 10:39.522
who operated on Yumiko-chan when she got sick.

10:39.856 --> 10:43.984
Oh, but we don't know him very well either.

10:43.985 --> 10:45.861
He was referred to us by someone else.

10:46.279 --> 10:49.865
He just asked for a very high fee.

10:49.866 --> 10:52.660
But we paid him up front.

10:52.661 --> 10:53.994
1,000,000,000 yen.

10:54.371 --> 10:57.581
But that's nothing compared to Yumiko's life.

10:59.459 --> 11:02.044
So, what does he look like?

11:02.543 --> 11:03.750
Well...

11:05.090 --> 11:06.507
Black Jack?

11:07.008 --> 11:08.133
You mean this?

11:09.177 --> 11:11.470
Unlicensed doctors wouldn't be listed.

11:11.972 --> 11:16.392
<i>Black Jack... Black Jack...</i>

11:19.646 --> 11:21.522
<i>I couldn't find anything.</i>

11:24.442 --> 11:26.235
Sharaku just left the classroom.

11:27.320 --> 11:28.529
Not today.

11:29.447 --> 11:31.323
Is anything wrong, Kong?

11:31.700 --> 11:35.474
Sign: Drama Club

11:35.537 --> 11:36.427
...attending ears!

11:36.607 --> 11:37.607
Romeo!

11:38.860 --> 11:39.713
My dear?

11:40.542 --> 11:41.834
At what o'clock to-morrow

11:41.835 --> 11:43.419
Shall I send to thee?

11:42.420 --> 11:43.420
Oh, yeah...

11:43.545 --> 11:44.295
Hey, Keaton!

11:46.381 --> 11:47.214
What is it, Kong?!

11:48.258 --> 11:51.010
Please, Keaton! Save my sister!

11:51.720 --> 11:52.970
Well...

11:53.346 --> 11:54.847
Please!

11:54.931 --> 11:57.474
Just play the role of Black Jack!

11:57.809 --> 11:59.310
Black Jack?

11:59.311 --> 12:03.314
But I can't cure her illness simply by playing a doctor.

12:03.648 --> 12:06.275
You just have to act like it.

12:07.110 --> 12:09.862
The real doctor will do the real work.

12:09.863 --> 12:13.282
But my sister will be happy just to see Black Jack.

12:13.283 --> 12:16.150
You know, worry is often the cause of illness!

12:16.369 --> 12:18.621
I'm only a kid, so she'll know.

12:18.788 --> 12:19.997
No, she won't!

12:19.998 --> 12:22.458
You're in the drama club, so you're good at role-playing.

12:22.459 --> 12:25.878
Besides, Chako wouldn't know what he looks like either.

12:26.182 --> 12:27.379
Please!

12:29.462 --> 12:32.760
You won't bully me or Sharaku anymore?

12:32.761 --> 12:34.027
No, l won't!

12:34.133 --> 12:34.904
I swear!

12:35.146 --> 12:35.813
Never!

12:37.287 --> 12:38.136
Fine.

12:38.967 --> 12:40.184
I'll try.

12:40.477 --> 12:44.813
Well, Black Jack's hair on his right side is white.

12:47.067 --> 12:48.526
He has a scar like this...

12:49.694 --> 12:51.028
Yeah, that's it.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.865
It's a bit loose, but oh well!

12:58.328 --> 13:01.163
So what kind of doctor is Black Jack?

13:01.498 --> 13:06.293
He's a real money-grubber, always
asking for lots of money.

13:25.844 --> 13:26.297
Now!

13:26.350 --> 13:26.964
Hurry!

13:39.870 --> 13:40.578
Chako.

13:40.829 --> 13:41.829
Nii-chan!

13:41.830 --> 13:43.873
I brought someone great today.

13:44.875 --> 13:45.583
Ta-da!

13:45.584 --> 13:46.959
It's Dr. Black Jack!

13:50.297 --> 13:53.174
Is he really Dr. Black Jack?

13:53.675 --> 13:55.551
Yeah, the brand spankin' new...

13:55.552 --> 13:58.262
I mean, the real Dr. Black Jack!

13:58.889 --> 14:01.015
<i>She's Kong's sister?!</i>

14:01.516 --> 14:03.475
So, Dr. Black Jack.

14:03.894 --> 14:05.394
So? So? So?

14:08.106 --> 14:09.679
I'm Black Jack.

14:09.992 --> 14:11.272
So you're Chako?

14:11.693 --> 14:13.152
Yes, I am.

14:14.696 --> 14:15.863
Let's get started.

14:15.864 --> 14:17.183
Yes, please.

14:17.574 --> 14:19.116
It took a lot to get him here.

14:19.659 --> 14:21.160
Thank you, Nii-chan.

14:28.543 --> 14:30.920
I got nervous in front of such a cute girl.

14:32.363 --> 14:34.924
You're funny, Dr. Black Jack.

14:36.927 --> 14:38.385
Well, let's start.

14:50.524 --> 14:51.732
Open your mouth.

14:54.236 --> 14:55.611
How does she look, Doctor?

14:56.637 --> 14:58.047
It's pretty serious.

14:58.091 --> 14:59.452
It will take a while.

14:59.824 --> 15:02.831
But, what's most important is your attitude.

15:03.119 --> 15:06.947
You must really believe that you will get better.

15:07.541 --> 15:10.542
Well, I will come see you every day, so don't worry.

15:11.044 --> 15:14.129
I will ask the doctors of this hospital to as well.

15:15.068 --> 15:15.679
Yes.

15:15.861 --> 15:16.551
Bye.

15:18.009 --> 15:20.219
I'll go send the doctor off.

15:20.512 --> 15:21.178
Yeah.

15:25.225 --> 15:27.573
Yeah! Yeah!

15:26.685 --> 15:28.435
That hurts, Kong.

15:28.728 --> 15:30.020
Oh, sorry.

15:30.647 --> 15:31.522
Yeah, way to go!

15:31.523 --> 15:32.731
That was it, Drama Club!

15:32.732 --> 15:33.941
She didn't notice?

15:33.942 --> 15:36.110
No, she didn't!

15:36.111 --> 15:37.236
She was happy!

15:37.237 --> 15:38.696
Thanks! Thanks!!

15:53.086 --> 15:54.670
Keaton, there you are.

15:55.380 --> 15:56.297
Kong!

15:56.298 --> 15:58.090
Please! Just one more time!

15:58.383 --> 15:59.675
Chako is waiting!

15:59.676 --> 16:00.259
Please?

16:00.260 --> 16:01.260
Just one more time!

16:01.261 --> 16:01.760
Please?

16:01.887 --> 16:02.595
Please?

16:09.060 --> 16:11.187
You are looking much better.

16:11.688 --> 16:12.897
Really, Doctor?

16:13.148 --> 16:13.731
Yeah.

16:13.732 --> 16:15.441
Are you eating well too?

16:15.442 --> 16:15.858
Yes.

16:20.363 --> 16:21.280
Drats!

16:22.699 --> 16:24.366
The real doctor is coming.

16:25.493 --> 16:29.872
I must operate on another patient,
so I must excuse myself now.

16:29.873 --> 16:30.414
See you tomorrow.

16:30.916 --> 16:32.625
Already?

16:33.335 --> 16:35.294
Don't be so selfish, Chako.

16:35.295 --> 16:37.671
Dr. Black Jack is super busy.

16:42.928 --> 16:43.888
Hi.

16:44.095 --> 16:45.387
How's your cough?

16:58.568 --> 17:00.277
I can't go on.

17:00.987 --> 17:03.801
I can't trick Chako-chan anymore.

17:03.990 --> 17:08.285
But Chako will be depressed if we stop now.

17:08.787 --> 17:11.997
Besides, you said "see you tomorrow."

17:12.247 --> 17:13.332
Yeah.

17:13.667 --> 17:15.209
Left, left, right!

17:15.418 --> 17:16.919
Left, left, right!

17:17.838 --> 17:20.256
I'll beat him up good!

17:23.635 --> 17:25.219
Ready, Sharaku?

17:32.185 --> 17:33.978
Ohmigewdness!

17:44.114 --> 17:45.903
Your temperature is lower than yesterday.

17:46.076 --> 17:47.867
There's nothing to worry about anymore.

17:51.329 --> 17:54.623
Chako-kun, this is my last visit.

17:55.041 --> 17:56.792
Just be confident.

17:57.627 --> 18:00.129
Chako, say thanks to the Doctor.

18:03.842 --> 18:05.968
Doctor, please operate on me!

18:06.209 --> 18:06.904
What?!

18:07.637 --> 18:12.016
The other doctor told me that I won't get
better unless they operate on me.

18:12.323 --> 18:13.517
Operation?!

18:13.518 --> 18:15.978
Chako, but this hospital's doctor will...

18:16.438 --> 18:17.229
No!

18:17.230 --> 18:19.440
I want Dr. Black Jack!

18:20.442 --> 18:21.942
No way...

18:22.235 --> 18:25.529
I want Dr. Black Jack to operate on me!

18:26.031 --> 18:27.698
Don't be so selfish, Chako!

18:27.866 --> 18:30.159
No! No! No!

18:31.369 --> 18:32.328
Fine!

18:32.370 --> 18:35.164
If you want me to operate on you,
then give me the operation fee!

18:35.665 --> 18:36.874
Operation fee?

18:37.459 --> 18:38.459
That's right.

18:38.793 --> 18:40.211
My fee is expensive.

18:40.462 --> 18:41.587
It's 1,000,000,000 yen!

18:41.588 --> 18:43.088
Do you still want me to operate on you?

18:43.548 --> 18:45.424
That much?

18:47.177 --> 18:49.512
I won't do it if you can't.

18:51.932 --> 18:53.390
Are you disillusioned now?

18:53.391 --> 18:54.308
That's right.

18:54.726 --> 18:56.678
Doctors may look like great people,

18:56.811 --> 18:59.813
but many of them are greedy people,
wanting only to make money!

19:02.275 --> 19:04.318
Stop admiring those doctors!

19:04.736 --> 19:05.622
It's stupid!

19:05.781 --> 19:06.862
He's right.

19:11.368 --> 19:13.452
The real Black Jack!

19:17.040 --> 19:18.791
Your words really spoke to my heart.

19:22.087 --> 19:28.507
I was only planning to look at her
after I was asked by Tezuka-kun.

19:28.718 --> 19:31.345
It sounded like this case wasn't
going to a get me much money.

19:32.222 --> 19:35.599
But what you said really made me want to treat her.

19:36.059 --> 19:38.060
A-are you sure, Black Jack?!

19:38.532 --> 19:40.563
I will operate on her.

19:40.839 --> 19:41.647
Good!

19:42.399 --> 19:43.482
You're really saving me!

19:45.068 --> 19:46.068
Thank you.

19:46.987 --> 19:49.864
Thank you, real Dr. Black Jack.

19:50.490 --> 19:52.408
But I will take the operation fee.

19:52.742 --> 19:53.299
Yes!

19:53.785 --> 20:00.082
OK, this Dr. Black Jack said 1,000,000,000 yen, so that's it.

20:01.293 --> 20:02.543
1,000,000,000 yen?!

20:03.461 --> 20:04.461
Can you pay?

20:05.797 --> 20:06.797
I will!

20:06.798 --> 20:08.966
I will work hard the rest of my life, and pay!

20:09.968 --> 20:12.094
So, what do you think?

20:12.964 --> 20:15.431
Well, I'm okay with 1,000 yen.

20:16.600 --> 20:17.558
1,000 yen...?

20:18.185 --> 20:20.978
Well, if this doctor says so, I can't help it.

20:21.271 --> 20:22.521
I'll go with that.

20:23.538 --> 20:24.481
Yay!

20:25.358 --> 20:26.942
Let's get started now.

20:27.360 --> 20:29.271
It's all prepared!

20:30.431 --> 20:32.573
So, let me take over,

20:32.991 --> 20:34.325
Dr. Black Jack.

20:35.493 --> 20:36.327
Yes!

20:37.078 --> 20:38.829
You'll make her well, right?

20:48.543 --> 20:50.508
Yeah! Yeah, Keaton!

20:50.509 --> 20:53.928
The real Dr. Black Jack will operate on her!

20:54.429 --> 20:55.721
That's so great, Kong!

20:55.722 --> 20:56.847
Yeah, yeah!

20:56.848 --> 20:57.431
Nii-chan!

20:59.226 --> 21:02.228
I'm sorry Chako, for tricking you.

21:02.229 --> 21:04.021
We didn't mean to hurt you.

21:04.022 --> 21:06.857
We just wanted to make you happy, and...

21:07.067 --> 21:08.442
It's okay, Nii-chan.

21:08.443 --> 21:13.489
You worked hard to find Dr. Black Jack for me, right?

21:14.533 --> 21:15.241
Yeah.

21:16.368 --> 21:18.911
I love you, Nii-chan.

21:22.408 --> 21:24.250
Dr. Black Jack,

21:24.626 --> 21:26.502
you were very wonderful.

21:27.629 --> 21:28.838
Chako-chan...

21:36.179 --> 21:39.390
We will probably find the bacteria in the cavities.

21:39.891 --> 21:41.684
Either way, it's not a serious case.

21:42.269 --> 21:44.144
Yeah, I'm counting on you.

21:44.437 --> 21:45.924
Ok, let's get started.

21:47.937 --> 21:50.664
Sign: Operation in progress

22:07.081 --> 22:19.036
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.081 --> 22:19.036
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.154 --> 22:24.153
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.154 --> 22:24.153
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.722 --> 22:31.191
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.722 --> 22:31.191
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.735 --> 22:37.193
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.735 --> 22:37.193
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.797 --> 22:40.282
being heated up by you,

22:37.797 --> 22:40.282
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.491 --> 22:48.268
so much that I change color

22:40.491 --> 22:48.268
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.353 --> 23:00.122
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.353 --> 23:00.122
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.330 --> 23:12.061
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.330 --> 23:12.061
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.301 --> 23:23.652
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.301 --> 23:23.652
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.838 --> 23:28.759
I couldn't be happier

23:23.838 --> 23:28.759
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.987 --> 23:33.921
How does it taste?

23:28.987 --> 23:33.920
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.147 --> 23:46.484
People are trapped!

23:46.634 --> 23:47.777
Are you a doctor too?

23:49.154 --> 23:50.905
We must elect a new chairman.

23:50.906 --> 23:52.323
Dr. Tokugawa!

23:52.647 --> 23:54.701
We have Dr. Shibata.

23:54.827 --> 23:56.622
I suppose there's Dr. Shiitake, too.

23:56.641 --> 23:57.954
I forgot about him.

23:58.664 --> 24:01.374
Oh, no, I'm just an ordinary staff member.

24:03.532 --> 24:06.869
The darkest star that the human eye can
recognize is known as a sixth-magnitude star.

24:07.369 --> 24:09.287
He's the sixth-magnitude man?

24:10.664 --> 24:13.708
Next Karte - The Sixth-Magnitude Man

24:15.961 --> 24:17.670
Pinoco's Diary...

24:19.510 --> 24:23.275
So, let me take over, Dr. Black Jack.
